# Rails writes `module ActiveSupport # :nodoc:` on some of the files that
# reopen it, and every public row under ActiveSupport lost its entry point:
# a `:nodoc:` anywhere hid everything nested anywhere under it. RDoc's
# `:nodoc:` hides that constant and the methods its body defines; nested
# classes stay documented, and only `:nodoc: all` reaches them (DEC-657).
